# Keeps the build context small and the layer cache stable. Without this,
# `COPY . .` pulls roughly 78MB of git history and design assets into the image
# build, and any screenshot or note added to design-handoff invalidates every
# layer after the copy.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
.claude

# Design masters: mockups, screenshots, prompt docs, and the full-quality audio
# the web-encoded tracks were made from. The audio the game actually serves
# lives in Server/wwwroot/audio and ships with the publish output.
design-handoff/

# Host build output. The image builds its own inside the SDK stage.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Repo documentation, not runtime files.
README.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
